# The gate the CI coverage-not-lost job runs (.github/workflows/ci.yml), after it writes the pull request's body
# into pr-inputs/. A report-only pilot (--soak): findings print as warnings and never fail the job, but a run that
# cannot be judged (exit 2) still does. The whole suite, under the python3 and unittest the test job uses, at the
# merge base and at the head; coverage.py measures every Python process a test starts, so the gate scripts the
# tests run are measured too.
coverage-not-lost --soak --runner unittest --args "discover -s tests" --body pr-inputs/body.md --timeout 3000
